# Environment
# Every .env variant carries secrets — the deploy-generated .env.users
# included. Two carry none and are therefore committed: .env.example, the
# documented variable list, and .env.shared, the deployment's shared defaults
# (`.env` beside it holds this host's own values, and wins on any key set in
# both).
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.shared
.venv
